      en: ["Trnovo has been split between two administrative entities since 1995.", "The Zeljeznica River originates in the mountains near the town.", "The settlement is situated at an altitude of approximately 800 meters.", "Surrounded by the Treskavica mountain range (highest peak 2,088m).", "The area witnessed significant battles during the siege of Sarajevo.", "Serves as a base for exploring the 1984 Winter Olympic mountain sites."],
