      en: ["The municipality was formed in 1995 following the Dayton Agreement.", "Donji Žabar is located directly on the border with the Brčko District.", "A major center for poultry farming and egg production in the region.", "The municipal territory is almost entirely composed of arable land.", "Situated along the M-14.1 main road connecting Bijeljina and Banja Luka.", "The total population of the municipality is around 3,800 residents."],
